==Irish==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ga|madradh}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ga|sga|[[madrad]], [[matrad]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=ga|[ˈmˠad̪ˠɾˠə]}}
* {{audio|ga-madra.ogg|play audio:|lang=ga}}

===Noun===
{{ga-noun|g=m|-|madraí}}

# [[dog]]
#: {{ux|ga|Is teann gach madra ag a dhoras féin.|inline=1|lit=Every dog is bold in his own door.|A cock is bold on his own dunghill. —Proverb}}
#: {{ux|ga|An té a bhuailfeadh mo mhadra bhuailfeadh sé mé féin.|inline=1|lit=Whoever beats my dog beats me.|Love me love my dog. —Proverb}}
#: {{ux|ga|Tá an madra marbh!|inline=1|lit=The dog is dead!|The fat is in the fire!}}

